---

<footer
  class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center bg-secondary bg-cover mt-8 pt-8 container px-5 m-auto max-w-screen-xl overflow-hidden sm:px-12 md:px-20"
>
  <a
    class="bg-linear-to-r from-teal-500 to-blue-500 px-12 py-2 rounded bg-[length:150%] duration-500 ease-out bg-left hover:bg-right"
    href="mailto:seth.bassetti@usu.edu"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
  >
    <span class="text-2xl text-white font-semibold">Get in touch 🤝</span>
  </a>

  <span class="text-md text-secondary-content">
    Feel free to email me about anything. I am happy to chat and discuss
    potential collaborations!
  </span>

  <span class="text-secondary-content self-start text-sm">
    Built with
    <a
      href="https://astro.build"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="underline inline"
